.SH BUGS
File descriptors 3 and above are not supported in redirections; such a line
is refused with
.BR "unsupported redirect fd" .
.PP
.B load()
is not supported; a
.B load(
line fails with Starlark's "load not implemented by this application".
.PP
Starlark has no set literal.
A line such as
.B "s = {1, 2}"
fails with a Starlark syntax error that names the fix; write
.BR "s = set([1, 2])" .
.PP
The history and fc commands read
.B ADSSH_HISTORY_FILE
while the interactive shell writes
.BR ADSSH_HISTORY .

